{"ku_id":"w_0001_the_ku01","headword":"the","sense_id":"w_0001_the_s01","ku_type":"Grammar","teaching_objective":"Use the definite article for an already introduced countable noun.","prompt":"I saw a dog outside. ___ dog was barking.","correct_answer":"The","explanation_zh":"第二次提及同一只狗，听者能够识别特定对象，使用the。","example_en":"I saw a dog. The dog was barking.","example_zh":"我看见一只狗。那只狗在叫。","source_attribution":[{"url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/grammar/british-grammar/a-an-the","claim":"grammar rule only"}],"identity_status":"LEGACY_ID_PRESERVED_FROZEN_RANK_FROM_CANONICAL_QUEUE","quality_status":"EDITORIAL_UNVERIFIED","evidence_status":"SOURCE_LINKED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_SIGNOFF","production_ready":false,"release_eligible":false,"missing_approvals":["sense_alignment","bilingual","us_ipa_pos_context","answer_quality","independent_editorial","runtime_e2e"]}
{"ku_id":"w_0005_to_ku02","headword":"to","sense_id":"w_0005_to_s01","ku_type":"Grammar","teaching_objective":"Use 'to' before infinitive after 'want'.","prompt":"They want ___ learn English.","correct_answer":"to","explanation_zh":"want后接动词不定式时通常使用want to do。","example_en":"They want to learn English.","example_zh":"他们想学习英语。","source_attribution":[{"url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/grammar/british-grammar/infinitives","claim":"grammar rule only"}],"identity_status":"LEGACY_ID_PRESERVED_FROZEN_RANK_FROM_CANONICAL_QUEUE","quality_status":"EDITORIAL_UNVERIFIED","evidence_status":"SOURCE_LINKED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_SIGNOFF","production_ready":false,"release_eligible":false,"missing_approvals":["sense_alignment","bilingual","us_ipa_pos_context","answer_quality","independent_editorial","runtime_e2e"]}
{"ku_id":"w_0008_have_ku02","headword":"have","sense_id":"w_0008_have_s01","ku_type":"Grammar","teaching_objective":"Choose the present-perfect auxiliary for third-person plural.","prompt":"They ___ already finished the work.","correct_answer":"have","explanation_zh":"现在完成时由have/has加过去分词构成；主语they选have。","example_en":"They have already finished the work.","example_zh":"他们已经完成了工作。","source_attribution":[{"url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/grammar/british-grammar/present-perfect-simple-i-have-worked","claim":"grammar rule only"}],"identity_status":"LEGACY_ID_PRESERVED_FROZEN_RANK_FROM_CANONICAL_QUEUE","quality_status":"EDITORIAL_UNVERIFIED","evidence_status":"SOURCE_LINKED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_SIGNOFF","production_ready":false,"release_eligible":false,"missing_approvals":["sense_alignment","bilingual","us_ipa_pos_context","answer_quality","independent_editorial","runtime_e2e"]}
{"ku_id":"w_0009_it_ku01","headword":"it","sense_id":"w_0009_it_s01","ku_type":"Grammar","teaching_objective":"Use formal subject 'it' before an adjective + to-infinitive.","prompt":"___ is important to check the results.","correct_answer":"It","explanation_zh":"英语句子通常需要显性主语，这里it充当形式主语。","example_en":"It is important to check the results.","example_zh":"检查结果很重要。","source_attribution":[{"url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/us/grammar/british-grammar/dummy-subjects","claim":"grammar rule only"}],"identity_status":"LEGACY_ID_PRESERVED_FROZEN_RANK_FROM_CANONICAL_QUEUE","quality_status":"EDITORIAL_UNVERIFIED","evidence_status":"SOURCE_LINKED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_SIGNOFF","production_ready":false,"release_eligible":false,"missing_approvals":["sense_alignment","bilingual","us_ipa_pos_context","answer_quality","independent_editorial","runtime_e2e"]}
{"ku_id":"w_0009_it_ku02","headword":"it","sense_id":"w_0009_it_s01","ku_type":"Grammar","teaching_objective":"Identify 'it' as a dummy subject, not as an object pronoun.","prompt":"In 'It is difficult to learn this rule', which word is the dummy subject?","correct_answer":"It","explanation_zh":"形式主语it占据主语位置，真正的语义主语是后面的不定式结构。","example_en":"It is difficult to learn this rule.","example_zh":"学习这条规则很难。","source_attribution":[{"url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/us/grammar/british-grammar/dummy-subjects","claim":"grammar rule only"}],"identity_status":"LEGACY_ID_PRESERVED_FROZEN_RANK_FROM_CANONICAL_QUEUE","quality_status":"EDITORIAL_UNVERIFIED","evidence_status":"SOURCE_LINKED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_SIGNOFF","production_ready":false,"release_eligible":false,"missing_approvals":["sense_alignment","bilingual","us_ipa_pos_context","answer_quality","independent_editorial","runtime_e2e"]}
{"ku_id":"w_0010_you_ku02","headword":"you","sense_id":"w_0010_you_s01","ku_type":"Grammar","teaching_objective":"Recognize generic 'you' referring to people in general.","prompt":"In 'You never know what will happen', does 'you' necessarily mean the listener?","correct_answer":"No; people in general","explanation_zh":"泛指you可表示一般人，并非一定指听话人。","example_en":"You never know what will happen.","example_zh":"谁也不知道接下来会发生什么。","source_attribution":[{"url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/grammar/british-grammar/pronouns-one-you-we-they.","claim":"grammar rule only"}],"identity_status":"LEGACY_ID_PRESERVED_FROZEN_RANK_FROM_CANONICAL_QUEUE","quality_status":"EDITORIAL_UNVERIFIED","evidence_status":"SOURCE_LINKED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_SIGNOFF","production_ready":false,"release_eligible":false,"missing_approvals":["sense_alignment","bilingual","us_ipa_pos_context","answer_quality","independent_editorial","runtime_e2e"]}
{"ku_id":"w_0013_they_ku02","headword":"they","sense_id":"w_0013_they_s01","ku_type":"Grammar","teaching_objective":"Identify generic 'they' for unspecified people or authorities.","prompt":"In 'They say it will rain tomorrow', does 'they' name a specific known group?","correct_answer":"No; unspecified people","explanation_zh":"泛指they可以指不具体说明的人或机构。","example_en":"They say it will rain tomorrow.","example_zh":"有人说明天会下雨。","source_attribution":[{"url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/grammar/british-grammar/pronouns-one-you-we-they.","claim":"grammar rule only"}],"identity_status":"LEGACY_ID_PRESERVED_FROZEN_RANK_FROM_CANONICAL_QUEUE","quality_status":"EDITORIAL_UNVERIFIED","evidence_status":"SOURCE_LINKED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_SIGNOFF","production_ready":false,"release_eligible":false,"missing_approvals":["sense_alignment","bilingual","us_ipa_pos_context","answer_quality","independent_editorial","runtime_e2e"]}
